\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Pete Buttigieg hits back at Fox News host\u8217\'20\'19s criticism of his paternity leave\b0\par\par\uc2 Jessica Glenza \par \uc2 438 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 October 2021\par 18:33 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2021.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The US transportation secretary and his husband recently adopted newborn twins and praised \u8216\'20\'18an administration that\u8217\'20\'19s actually pro-family\u8217\'20\'19\par \par \uc2 US transportation secretary Pete Buttigieg, who has been on paternity leave since mid-August with newborn twins, called right-wing attacks on his paternity leave \u8220\'20\'1Cstrange\u8221\'20\'1D and from \u8220\'20\'1Ca side of the aisle that used to claim the mantle of being pro-family\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Buttigieg \u8211\'20\'13 who is gay \u8211\'20\'13 was the subject of criticism from Fox News host \uc2 Tucker Carlson\uc2  on Thursday, who belittled the secretary\u8217\'20\'19s paternity leave while making homophobic comments and criticizing the administration for supply chain woes.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIn his case, I guess he just doesn\u8217\'20\'19t understand the concept of bottle feeding let alone the concept of paternity leave,\u8221\'20\'1D Buttigieg said about Carlson on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.msnbc.com/deadline-white-house/watch/buttigieg-biden-s-work-on-supply-chain-bottleneck-will-make-a-difference-to-improve-delays-123675717904"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MSNBC}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CWhat we have right now is an administration that\u8217\'20\'19s actually pro-family,\u8221\'20\'1D said Buttigieg, who adopted newborn twins with his husband Chasten.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19m blessed to experience that as an employee, being able to have the flexibility to take care of our newborn children, which is by the way, work, it\u8217\'20\'19s joyful work, it\u8217\'20\'19s wonderful work, but it\u8217\'20\'19s definitely work,\u8221\'20\'1D Buttigieg added.\par \par \uc2 The comments came after an attack by Carlson on his show. \u8220\'20\'1CPete Buttigieg has been on leave from his job since August after adopting a child,\u8221\'20\'1D \uc2 Tucker Carlson{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.mediamatters.org/fox-news/tucker-carlsons-snide-dismissal-paternity-leave-stark-contrast-his-colleagues-fervent"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told his Fox News audience}}}\uc2  on Thursday. \u8220\'20\'1CPaternity leave, they call it, trying to figure out how to breastfeed \u8211\'20\'13 no word on how that went.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In fact, Fox News provides paternity leave, and Carlson\u8217\'20\'19s colleagues have previously praised the company\u8217\'20\'19s six weeks of paid leave on-air.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThey give us six weeks as dads for paternity and I\u8217\'20\'19m taking that six weeks,\u8221\'20\'1D Fox & Friends co-host Todd Piro {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.distractify.com/p/what-happened-to-todd-piro-on-fox-news"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told his viewers}}}\uc2  in March, according to the left-leaning research center \uc2 Media Matters for America\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CI can\u8217\'20\'19t wait to bond with my little one.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Similarly, Fox host Jesse Watters said he was \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thehill.com/homenews/media/547893-jesse-watters-after-birth-of-son-now-i-am-pro-paternity"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pro-paternity}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D after taking six weeks following the birth of his third child.\par \par \uc2 A transportation spokesperson said Buttigieg has been \u8220\'20\'1Cramping up activities\u8221\'20\'1D and is expected to \u8220\'20\'1Ccontinue to take some time over the coming weeks to support his husband and take care of his new children\u8221\'20\'1D, according to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/newsletters/west-wing-playbook/2021/10/14/can-pete-buttigieg-have-it-all-494710"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Politico}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Carlson is one of the most controversial figures in US media with a history of extremist and racist statements that have often angered advertisers but have won him a hardcore fanbase that makes his show consistently one of the most popular on cable news.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020211016ehag001up\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
