\par\par \uc2 Business\par \b \uc2 Morgan Stanley\uc2  to bar unvaccinated staff from New York offices\b0\par\par\uc2 Jillian Ambrose \par \uc2 463 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 June 2021\par 11:09 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2021.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bank warns staff they have less than three weeks to take both Covid jabs or continue working from homeCoronavirus \u8211\'20\'13 latest updatesSee all our coronavirus coverage\par \par \uc2 Employees and visitors to \uc2 Morgan Stanley\uc2  will be barred from entering the bank\u8217\'20\'19s New York offices unless they are fully vaccinated against Covid-19 from next month, as the Wall Street firm prepares to get staff back to their desks by early September.\par \par \uc2 The banking company told staff and clients that they have less than three weeks to receive both coronavirus jabs before visiting its buildings in New York City and Westchester from 12 July \u8211\'20\'13 or keep working from home.\par \par \uc2 A memo from the Wall Street bank, reported by the \uc2 Financial Times\uc2 , said says: \u8220\'20\'1CStarting July 12 all employees, contingent workforce, clients and visitors will be required to attest to being fully vaccinated to access \uc2 Morgan Stanley\uc2  buildings in New York City and Westchester.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Morgan Stanley\uc2  is not expected to ask staff and visitors to provide proof of their vaccination status, but the double-jab requirement may result in relaxing restrictions on social distancing and face coverings in its New York office spaces. The requirement is not expected to apply to the bank\u8217\'20\'19s international offices.\par \par \uc2 The new entry requirements were set out in a staff memo just over a week after the chief executive, \uc2 James Gorman\uc2 , said he was issuing a \u8220\'20\'1Cvery strong\u8221\'20\'1D message to workers to get {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2021/jun/15/morgan-stanley-boss-tells-us-staff-to-be-back-in-office-in-september"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 back to their desks by Labor Day on 6 September}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Gorman told the bank\u8217\'20\'19s New York employees \u8211\'20\'13 who make up 90% of the company\u8217\'20\'19s total staff \u8211\'20\'13 that anyone who felt safe going to a restaurant should return to the office. \uc2 Morgan Stanley\uc2  employees in India and the UK would need to take a different approach owing to ongoing Covid restrictions, he added.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CMake no mistake about it: we do our work inside {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/morganstanley"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Morgan Stanley}}}\uc2  offices. And that\u8217\'20\'19s where we teach, that\u8217\'20\'19s where our interns learn, that\u8217\'20\'19s how we develop people,\u8221\'20\'1D Gorman told a financial services conference.\par \par \uc2 Morgan Stanley\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s push to return to pre-pandemic working patterns is the latest in a string of calls from the US\u8217\'20\'19s largest bankers to return to the office. The chief executive of Goldman Sachs, \uc2 David Solomon\uc2 , has referred to remote working as an \u8220\'20\'1Caberration\u8221\'20\'1D, and \uc2 JP Morgan\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s boss, \uc2 Jamie Dimon\uc2 , said it was poor practice for new and younger staff, as well as employees who wanted \u8220\'20\'1Cto hustle\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Across Europe, banks are taking a more flexible approach to the return to work. \uc2 NatWest Group\uc2  expects {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2021/jun/01/natwest-preparing-for-just-13-of-staff-to-work-in-office-full-time"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 just 13% of its 64,000 employees}}}\uc2  to work in the office full-time. Meanwhile, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2021/apr/07/thousands-of-hsbc-and-jp-morgan-staff-to-work-at-home-regularly"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HSBC is planning for thousands}}}\uc2  of its staff to work remotely long-term.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020210623eh6n0012y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
